# GSD protocols

When executing work from `PRD.md`:

1. File-first context — re-read target files before editing.
2. One task per turn; verify; append `progress.txt`; then stop.
3. Never invent scope outside the active PRD.
4. Keep `.planning/STATE.md` accurate at phase handoff.
5. Anti-hallucination — verify uncertain APIs via Context7 or docs; say when unsure.
6. Use workflows under `.agents/workflows/` and `.agent/workflows/` (gsd-plan, gsd-execute, gsd-verify, ralph-loop, etc.) when the user invokes those flows.
